  {
   "id": "polterguys-217098@major-2025-08-13",
   "gameId": "polterguys-217098",
   "displayName": "Patch Update – Weekly Leaderboards Are Here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-08-13T15:30:59.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey fellow ghouls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The new patch is live today and here’s what’s in it",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Weekly leaderboards are in. Compete for the top spot each week.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quickplay flow rework. Groups now stay together between rounds. Solos can join games in progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Haunt decor is cheaper. Candy prices reduced.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New unlockables. Flamingo (Haunt) and Snowman (Riptide Reef 2).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes. Exploits patched. Bugs squashed. Performance improved. Menus cleaned up.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quality of life. Skippable intro screens. Improved input rebinding. Better region and watermark display.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42918594/1f4fb2552a0166713495eddc949c15c1854035c6.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Each week's leaderboard winner will get to wear the exclusive costume throughout the following week. It’s not a permanent unlock, but a temporary reward that shifts to whoever holds the top spot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re also planning to award a permanent emote as a separate prize for leaderboard winners - more on that soon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
